        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 281.07,
          "end": 283.02,
          "en": "So of course, you have to solve the problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 283.02,
          "end": 285.829,
          "en": "So, compiler is helping you by showing the problem, right?",
